WEBVTT

00:07:58.505 --> 00:08:02.474
But what that tombstone should have said,

00:08:02.498 --> 00:08:05.172
in an alternative lifetime,

00:08:05.196 --> 00:08:09.648
what it should have said if it was
your highest expression of talent,

00:08:09.672 --> 00:08:14.224
was, "Here lies the last
Nobel Laureate in Physics,

00:08:14.248 --> 00:08:17.589
who formulated
the Grand Unified Field Theory

00:08:17.613 --> 00:08:21.016
and demonstrated
the practicality of warp drive."

00:08:21.602 --> 00:08:23.781
(Laughter)

00:08:23.805 --> 00:08:25.552
Velcro, indeed!

00:08:25.576 --> 00:08:27.061
(Laughter)

00:08:28.686 --> 00:08:30.519
One was a great career.